# Feralas (Horde) - Completionist (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# The Horde side of contested Feralas: 39 quests on key 1444
# (docs/feralas-horde-census.md), routed from Camp Mojache. The 46
# Alliance accepts stay with the Alliance guide; 7481/7489 run above
# the band and stay out. Chain order is strictly turn-in-before-accept.
# The Wild Leather chain (2854-2860) is Leatherworking bench work under
# a skill gate. Two accepts whose pres sit outside every pack contract
# (2981 and 3122, both Orgrimmar) ride dedicated `when onquest`
# mini-steps, each standing alone. The Gordunni Scroll (2978) is
# sourceless in the data and rides a bag note; the Perfect Yeti Hide
# (7738) hunts on the Feral Scar grounds. Expedition turn-ins
# (Orgrimmar, Thunder Bluff, Tanaris) and expedition completes
# (Hinterlands, Felwood) switch frames and switch back.
guide butler-routes-completionist/feralas-horde
title Feralas (Horde)
levels 38-50
zone Feralas
faction Horde
category Leveling
folder Completionist
coords live
version 1

step Camp Mojache - mustering

  tip Camp Mojache holds the chains: Jangdor Swiftstrider (74.43, 42.91) posts the hide and leather work, Hadoken Swiftstrider (74.91, 42.46) runs the Woodpaw war, Krueg Skullsplitter (75.94, 42.74) wants sprite wings and grim horns, Rok Orhan (75.8, 43.58) holds the Gordunni war, Orwin Gizzmick (75.7, 44.31) assays cobalt, Talo Thornhoof (76.18, 43.83) hunts the north and the corruption, Uzer'i (74.42, 43.36) brews the muisek vessels and names the Sunken Temple, Blaise Montgomery (74.91, 44.02) lost his words, and Innkeeper Greul (74.8, 45.18) keeps the bunks. Take every hub ask here; the wilds fill them.
  accept 2822 -- The Mark of Quality - Jangdor Swiftstrider; ten Thick Yeti Hides, south-center
  accept 2862 -- War on the Woodpaw - Hadoken Swiftstrider; ten Woodpaw Gnoll Manes, east
  accept 2973 -- A New Cloak's Sheen - Krueg Skullsplitter; ten Iridescent Sprite Darter Wings, east
  note The Gordunni Scroll (2978's starter) has no placed dropper in the data - have the scroll in your bags; Rok takes it on the south-west leg below.
  accept 2978 optional -- The Gordunni Scroll - the scroll; Rok Orhan takes it, south-west
  accept 2987 -- Gordunni Cobalt - Orwin Gizzmick; twelve Gordunni Cobalt off the Dirt Mounds, east
  accept 3062 -- Dark Heart - Talo Thornhoof; Edana's Dark Heart, far north-west
  accept 3063 -- Vengeance on the Northspring - Talo Thornhoof; Northspring harpies, north-west
  accept 4120 -- The Strength of Corruption - Talo Thornhoof; Angerclaw and Felpaw in Felwood, late
  accept 3121 -- A Strange Request - Witch Doctor Uzer'i; Neeru Fireblade waits in Orgrimmar, late
  accept 3380 -- The Sunken Temple - Witch Doctor Uzer'i; Marvon Rivetseeker waits in Tanaris, late
  accept 92878 -- Lost for Words - Blaise Montgomery; Namida's Hoof, east
  note The Perfect Yeti Hide (7738's starter) drops off the Feral Scar yetis - the guide never wedges on it: hunt the south-center grounds below, take the quest, hand in at Jangdor.

step Jangdor's bench (Leatherworking)

  when skill Leatherworking 1

  tip Jangdor's bench is crafted goods - have the leather and kits in your bags.
  accept 2854 -- Wild Leather Armor - Jangdor Swiftstrider; Thick Leather for the armor
  complete 2854 -- ten Thick Leather for Jangdor's armor
  turnin 2854 -- Wild Leather Armor - the armor to Jangdor Swiftstrider
  accept 2855 -- Wild Leather Shoulders - Jangdor Swiftstrider; kits and Wildvine for the shoulders
  complete 2855 -- armor kits and Wildvine for the shoulders
  turnin 2855 -- Wild Leather Shoulders - the shoulders to Jangdor Swiftstrider
  accept 2856 -- Wild Leather Vest - Jangdor Swiftstrider; turtle scale for the vest
  complete 2856 -- turtle scale and Wildvine for the vest
  turnin 2856 -- Wild Leather Vest - the vest to Jangdor Swiftstrider
  accept 2857 -- Wild Leather Helmet - Jangdor Swiftstrider; nightscape for the helmet
  complete 2857 -- nightscape and Wildvine for the helmet
  turnin 2857 -- Wild Leather Helmet - the helmet to Jangdor Swiftstrider
  accept 2858 -- Wild Leather Boots - Jangdor Swiftstrider; nightscape for the boots
  complete 2858 -- nightscape and Wildvine for the boots
  turnin 2858 -- Wild Leather Boots - the boots to Jangdor Swiftstrider
  accept 2859 -- Wild Leather Leggings - Jangdor Swiftstrider; turtle scale for the leggings
  complete 2859 -- turtle scale and Wildvine for the leggings
  turnin 2859 -- Wild Leather Leggings - the leggings to Jangdor Swiftstrider
  accept 2860 -- Master of the Wild Leather - Jangdor Swiftstrider; Una takes the mastery, late
  note 2860's turn-in is a Thunder Bluff expedition - the leg below carries it; her onward work is outside this contract.

step South-center - Feral Scar yetis

  goto 52.26,57.93
  goto 55.29,53.76

  tip The Feral Scar yetis range the south-center; the Lurking Feral Scar works alone south-east of them.
  complete 2822 @52.26,57.93 era -- ten Thick Yeti Hides for Jangdor Swiftstrider, south-center
  kill 7848 optional -- Lurking Feral Scar for the Perfect Yeti Hide
  note The hide starts 7738 in your bags - take the quest on the return below and hand it in with the Mark's hides.

step Camp Mojache - hides banked

  turnin 2822 -- The Mark of Quality - the hides to Jangdor Swiftstrider
  accept 7734 -- Improved Quality - Jangdor Swiftstrider; ten Rage Scar Yeti Hides, north-west
  accept 7738 -- Perfect Yeti Hide - the hide; Jangdor Swiftstrider takes it
  turnin 7738 -- Perfect Yeti Hide - the hide to Jangdor Swiftstrider

