step Felwood - the Strength of Corruption (expedition)

  zone Felwood

  tip The Angerclaw Grizzlies and Felpaw Ravagers share the Felwood dens around (53-58, 20-28) - twelve of each for Talo.
  complete 4120 @55.63,23.37 era -- twelve Angerclaw Grizzlies for Talo Thornhoof, Felwood
  complete 4120 @55.54,26.94 era -- twelve Felpaw Ravagers for Talo Thornhoof, Felwood
