step Orgrimmar - turnins and pickups (expedition)

  zone Orgrimmar

  goto 49.47,50.59
  goto 75.23,34.24
  goto 56.26,46.68
  goto 39.16,86.27

  tip Neeru Fireblade (49.47, 50.59) takes Uzer'i's strange ask; Belgrom Rockmaul (75.23, 34.24) takes Krueg's grim word; Zilzibin Drumlore (56.26, 46.68) takes Hadoken's hive word; Uthel'nay (39.16, 86.27) takes Rok's orb. The two out-of-contract pres below are named pickups, not pack content - take them in the city and the Feralas minis below unlock.
  turnin 3121 -- A Strange Request - the ask to Neeru Fireblade
  note 3122 (the Testing vessel follow-up) accepts at Neeru Fireblade here - take it and 3123 rides its own soft-pre step once 3122 is in the log.
  turnin 2976 -- A Grim Discovery - the discovery to Belgrom Rockmaul
  note 2981 (the Ogres of Feralas pre) accepts at Belgrom Rockmaul here - take it and 2975 rides its own soft-pre step once 2981 is in the log.
  turnin 7732 -- Zukk'ash Report - the report to Zilzibin Drumlore
  turnin 3002 -- The Gordunni Orb - the orb to Uthel'nay
  zone Feralas

step Rok's ogres (soft pre)

  when onquest 2981

  tip Holding 2981 (the Ogres pre, from Belgrom Rockmaul in Orgrimmar): Rok's eastern ask.
  accept 2975 -- The Ogres of Feralas - Rok Orhan; Gordunni Ogres, Mages and Brutes, east

step Uzer'i's vessels (soft pre)

  when onquest 3122

  tip Holding 3122 (the vessel follow-up, from Neeru Fireblade in Orgrimmar): Uzer'i's asks.
  accept 3123 -- Testing the Vessel - Witch Doctor Uzer'i; ten Wildkin Muisek - the owls range the Hinterlands, late
  note 3123's owls live outside Feralas - the Hinterlands expedition below gathers them; hand 3123 in on the return.
  accept 3128 -- Natural Materials - Witch Doctor Uzer'i; logs, minerals, sinew and fragments across the zone
  note 3128's components fill alongside the muisek legs below - hand the set in with the vessels at the end.

