  turnin 3126 -- Treant Muisek - the muisek to Witch Doctor Uzer'i
  accept 3127 -- Mountain Giant Muisek - Witch Doctor Uzer'i; seven Mountain Giant Muisek off the Land Walkers and Cliff Giants, north-west

step North-west - mountain giants

  tip The Land Walkers and Cliff Giants stride the north-west around (37-41, 18-25); their fragments close Uzer'i's material set.
  complete 3127 @37.76,21.92 era -- seven Mountain Giant Muisek for Witch Doctor Uzer'i, north-west
  complete 3128 @37.76,21.92 era -- Metallic Fragments off the giants for Witch Doctor Uzer'i, north-west

step Camp Mojache - the vessels closed

  turnin 3127 -- Mountain Giant Muisek - the muisek to Witch Doctor Uzer'i
