step Thunder Bluff - Una's mastery (expedition)

  zone Thunder Bluff

  tip Una (41.5, 42.57) takes Jangdor's mastery in Thunder Bluff; she also walks Mulgore (38.2, 25.5) if the road gives her first.
  turnin 2860 -- Master of the Wild Leather - the mastery to Una @41.5,42.57 era
  zone Feralas

step Tanaris - the Sunken Temple word (expedition)

  zone Tanaris

  tip Marvon Rivetseeker (52.71, 45.92) takes Uzer'i's temple word in Gadgetzan; his chain runs on in the pack's Tanaris guide.
  turnin 3380 -- The Sunken Temple - the word to Marvon Rivetseeker @52.71,45.92 era
  zone Feralas
